WEBVTT

00:00.590 --> 00:05.190
Mzingo wa bustani ya mstatili ya Tina ni futi 60.

00:05.190 --> 00:09.980
Kama urefu wa bustani ni mara mbili ya upana,

00:09.980 --> 00:12.580
ni nini urefu na upana wa bustani?

00:12.580 --> 00:15.190
Hebu tuchore hii bustani ya Tina hapa.

00:15.190 --> 00:16.750
Ni mstatili.

00:16.750 --> 00:19.010
Wametuambia ni bustani ya mstatili.

00:19.010 --> 00:21.500
Kwa hiyo inaonekana kama hivi.

00:21.500 --> 00:23.230
Na tuseme huu ni upana.

00:23.230 --> 00:24.646
Kwa hiyo kama huu ni upana, huu

00:24.646 --> 00:26.110
pia utakwenda kuwa upana.

00:26.110 --> 00:27.900
Na huu hapa ni urefu.

00:27.900 --> 00:30.070
Na wametuambia urefu wa bustani

00:30.070 --> 00:31.570
ni mara mbili ya upana.

00:31.570 --> 00:35.310
Kwa hiyo kama hii ni w, urefu utakwenda kuwa 2w.

00:35.310 --> 00:36.910
Utakwenda kuwa mara mbili ya upana.

00:36.910 --> 00:40.870
Hii pia itakwenda kuwa 2w hapa.

00:40.870 --> 00:42.910
Sasa mzingo wa bustani hii ni ngapi?

00:42.910 --> 00:46.502
Itakwenda kuwa w jumlisha w jumlisha 2w jumlisha 2w.

00:46.502 --> 00:47.460
Ngoja niiandike hii chini.

00:47.460 --> 00:49.001
Mzingo wa bustani utakwenda kuwa

00:49.001 --> 00:57.370
sawa na w jumlisha 2w jumlisha w jumlisha 2w, ambayo

00:57.370 --> 00:58.460
ni sawa na ngapi?

00:58.460 --> 01:03.300
Hii ni w jumlisha 2w ni 3w, jumlisha w ni 4w, jumlisha 2w ni 6w.

01:03.300 --> 01:05.560
Kwa hiyo hii ni 6w.

01:05.560 --> 01:07.770
Huo ni mzingo katika vipimo vya upana

01:07.770 --> 01:12.090
Lakini wametuambia

01:12.090 --> 01:15.000
mzingo ni futi 60.

01:15.000 --> 01:16.870
Ni futi 60.

01:16.870 --> 01:21.070
Kwa hiyo huu mzingo 6w ni sawa na 60.

01:21.070 --> 01:23.310
kama tukichulia tunashughulika na futi

01:23.310 --> 01:27.320
Kwa hiyo tuna mlinganyo 6w ni sawa na 60.

01:27.320 --> 01:29.330
Tunaweza kugawanya pande zote za mlinganyo huu

01:29.330 --> 01:33.410
kwa 6 ili tubaki na w upande wa kushoto.

01:33.410 --> 01:36.380
6w gawanya kwa 6 ni w.

01:36.380 --> 01:39.780
Na 60 gawanya kwa 6 ni 10.

01:39.780 --> 01:41.820
Kwa hiyo w ni sawa na 10.

01:41.820 --> 01:44.580
Kwa hiyo upana wa bustani ni 10.

01:44.580 --> 01:47.160
Kwa hiyo umbali huu hapa ni 10.

01:47.160 --> 01:49.210
Na halafu urefu wa bustani ni ngapi?

01:49.210 --> 01:51.010
Ni mara mbili ya upana.

01:51.010 --> 01:53.000
Kwa hiyo ni 20.

01:53.000 --> 01:56.570
Urefu ni sawa na 20.

01:56.570 --> 01:57.320
Na tumemaliza

01:57.320 --> 02:00.567
Hii ni bustani ya futi 20 kwa futi 10.
